# The test suite imports checkout-only drivers (scripts/, experiments/) via
# the root conftest.py, registry tests read results/, and one CLI test runs
# examples/mini/. All ship in the sdist so the distributed tests run; the
# wheel still installs only the src/ ppb package (see
# [tool.setuptools.packages.find] in pyproject.toml).
graft scripts
graft experiments
graft results
graft examples
include conftest.py
global-exclude __pycache__ *.pyc *.pyo
